{"id":"atlas-intro","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":3600,"height":200,"text":"**Utility apps / NOS · 1.43-B**\n\n40 system members · 26 one-hop ghost neighbours · 56 canonical edges\nEvery incoming and outgoing edge of a member is shown, including parallel edges. Ghost cards retain status text and gap badges; grey borders mark neighbours unless a high/critical gap requires red. Arrows retain source direction; MISSING means an absent connection, not working data flow.\nCyan data · orange control · green persist · purple schedule · yellow UI · red event.\n[[NOS System Map.canvas|Return to overview]]","color":"5"},
{"id":"hw-qmi8658-imu","type":"text","x":1188,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**QMI8658 IMU (0x6B)**\n6-axis accelerometer/gyro, INT on GPIO8 (not…\n\nruns: Hardware. Read about 150 times/s by board-sense, with the screen on or off.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|4 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"hw-strap-env","type":"text","x":1644,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Strap: BME280 baro/temp/humidity**\nOptional environment sensor strap: pressure,…\n\nruns: Hardware. Forced-mode read every 2 s once present.\n\n`UNKNOWN` · ⚠ [[Gaps|3 gaps]]\n[[Utility apps|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER"},
{"id":"hw-strap-mag","type":"text","x":2100,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Strap: QMC5883L/HMC5883L compass**\nOptional magnetometer strap for the Compass…\n\nruns: Hardware. Sampled only while a consumer asks.\n\n`UNKNOWN` · ⚠ [[Gaps|5 gaps]]\n[[Utility apps|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER"},
