{"id":"hw-strap-light","type":"text","x":3468,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Strap: APDS-9960 light/proximity**\nOptional ambient-light and proximity strap.…\n\nruns: Hardware. Read about every 400 ms by the ext task.\n\n`UNKNOWN` · ⚠ [[Gaps|3 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER"},
{"id":"hw-strap-haptic","type":"text","x":3924,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Strap: coin ERM haptic motor**\nOptional vibration motor strap driven by PWM…\n\nruns: Hardware. Pattern segments timed by the haptic esp_timer.\n\n`UNKNOWN` · ⚠ [[Gaps|2 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER"},
